# Email templates are RENDERED, not just read. Prettier reflows markdown —
# wrapping lines, renumbering lists, normalising emphasis — and every one of
# those changes what lands in a customer's inbox. This directory is loaded at
# runtime by shared/src/templates/loader.ts and sent by the email transport, so
# formatting it is a content change wearing a whitespace diff.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored, `templates/` is a gitignore-style
# pattern that matches a directory of that name at ANY depth — which swallowed
# 11 tracked source files under packages/outpost/shared/src/templates/ and
# apps/web/src/app/**/templates/, exempting them from both the CI check and
# `pnpm format` with no way to bring them back into compliance.
/templates/

# Skill definitions under .claude/skills/ are hand-maintained spec prose, and
# several carry wide reference tables. Prettier pads every cell out to the
# widest one, so a one-word edit rewrites the whole table and the real change
# disappears into the diff. Anchored so it matches the directory at the repo
# root rather than any `skills` directory at any depth.
/.claude/skills/

# Operational dedup state for Reddit Pulse — appended by the weekly-report
# routine rather than written by hand, and 2-space by construction. Formatting
# it to the repo's 4-space width reindents all 412 lines and would do so again
# after every run.
/docs/community-signal/reddit-pulse-seen.json

# CLAUDE.md is the same class as the skill definitions above: hand-maintained
# spec prose carrying a wide trigger/skill reference table, where padding every
# cell to the widest one buries the real change on any future edit.
/CLAUDE.md
